# panels: the inventory, the character sheet, the camp menu: mostly the driver's text, shapes and rectangles.
option save fixtures/EOBDATA.SAV
idle
mark load
key ENTER
idle
mark inv
key i
shot inv
key F2
key F3
key F1
mark sheet
key p
shot sheet
key F2
key F3
mark map
key i
mark camp
key c
shot camp
key ESC
shot end
idle
quit
